      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BELIEVEITOR NOT (5) resumes after finishing fourth at her latest appearance at Carrick on March 8. Talented and has plenty of upside. Beautifully placed and is sure to be there at the finish. ROCKET RALPH (9) went back last start then worked home in good style to finish just a neck from the winner in second at Menangle over 1609m, adding to his list of strong recent results. Shouldn't spend a penny from this draw and the sprint lane may come in handy. This is a nice drop in grade so he is in the right race to find the winners' list. DESIGNA LABEL (8) should be ready to peak now after finishing second over 1720m at Penrith two-and-a-half weeks ago. Expect her to give this a real shake. RUBATEEKI (6) disappointed last time but is a chance based on a good second over 1609m at Newcastle two runs back.",
